{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"But why would you use these if there was a chance of getting your body back?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:35:18.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870087053243736104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Because I didn't believe there was a chance... my original body has been taken a way so many times... I felt like fate didn't want me to ever be happy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:36:25.952000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T23:36:32.488000Z","id":"870087334358552638","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"It's a matter of getting the funds to do it. If we did, I could even be the one to cast it on you, or my friend Ben Franklin\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:37:04.807000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870087497328255017","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Its too late.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:37:26.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870087586473988127","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I already made an unbreakable oath.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:37:35.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870087625132871681","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
