{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"You didn't have to take the oath... I could have helped you..\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:40:11.312000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870088279586906152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"He holds his head in his hands, distraught","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:40:25.847000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T23:41:05.670000Z","id":"870088340551135262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"My... my stuff.. is in my locker... give it to someone who needs it...\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:40:29.018000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870088353851260949","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I'm sorry... I'm sorry... I'm sorry...\" Willow repeats, crying.","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:41:22.018000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870088576149372969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"What exactly were the words of the oath you made. There can be a way out. Was there any ambiguous moments of it\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:43:09.366000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870089026399518720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"No. I promised that I would give up my voice to have a quiet and peaceful existence tending to the grove.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:45:55.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870089724776288286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"We're those.. The *exact* words?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:46:33.539000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870089882763165696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"The exact words were: I intend to silently watch over the grove and its dead. I will promise my voice in payment for a life of simple service and quiet duty, but first I must tie up loose ends. I promise to return when my business is complete, and will give up my voice then.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:47:35.454000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870090142453497926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"When your business is complete!\" he holds his hand in the air as if discovering hope\n\n\"I could give you a job or duty and then you have a way out of it! In that time we can work on getting you back to your original form!\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:50:37.017000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870090903983894579","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Finn... I...\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:51:05.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091023332823071","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I'm sorry...\" Willow turns away.","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:51:37.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091158070628363","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Find someone better than me... someone worthy of you...\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:51:59.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091251947565067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"It's not about me or us! It's about giving you what you've fought so hard for already!\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:52:35.044000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091399025004604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I'd still have to go there after... even if we got my old body back...\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:53:08.938000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091541186740254","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"Identity is important and I understand that. So that's why I want to help you retain yours. Okay, so I give you a job that lasts until you're old and tired then you'll fulfill your promise and have your body and a life full of memories\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T23:53:44.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870091690617241621","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
